WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.635
-Our next guest is the director

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:05.271
of the National Institute of
Allergy and Infectious Diseases

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.840
and the chief medical advisor
to President Joe Biden.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.543
Here's Dr. Anthony Fauci!

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:13.279
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.750
Oh. Thank you so much
for being here.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.984
-Good to be with you, Jimmy.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.452
-I appreciate this.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.687
Where are you coming to us from?

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.655
From Washington?

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:23.790
-Yeah. Bethesda, Maryland,

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.424
just a little bit north
of Washington,

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.627
which is the headquarters
of the NIH.

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:31.598
-Ah. What foods are in Bethesda?

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:32.866
-Excuse me?

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:34.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.436
-What foods you like
over there in Bethesda?

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:37.971
I thought you were
going to say D.C.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:40.606
I was going to bring up a Ben's
Chili Bowl or something, but --

00:00:40.606 --> 00:00:41.907
-[ Chuckles ]

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:44.377
Well, this is Maryland,
so crabs are in right now.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.645
-Yeah, that's
what I'm talking about.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.880
Yeah, alright.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.515
I'm happy to be talking to you.

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:51.817
And it's almost bizarre
talking to you

00:00:51.817 --> 00:00:54.187
because I'm talking to you
on the screen.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.489
Normally, I'm watching you
on the screen talking to me,

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:57.957
so this is a little bizarre.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:01.193
But I just wanted to thank you
for getting us through this --

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:02.895
or almost through this pandemic

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:05.131
and everything
you've done for us.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.465
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:10.336
Because, gosh, you were there
every step of the way.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:14.974
And you're really, like,
such a welcome face

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.208
to see on the screen

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.478
and someone that talks
with common sense.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.979
We just all appreciated it.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:24.217
And I just want to thank you,
on behalf of many Americans,

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:25.485
but definitely me.

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.052
-Thank you, Jimmy.
That's very nice of you.

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:28.188
Thank you.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.723
-You have a new
administration now.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:33.893
You have President Biden
and Kamala Harris.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:37.062
How's it been going
working with them?

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:38.197
-Very well, actually.

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:41.401
You know, the issue here
is that everything we do

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.536
is based on science
and evidence and data.

00:01:44.536 --> 00:01:47.106
And right now, the major thrust
of what we're doing

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:51.544
is implementing the vaccine plan
of getting people vaccinated,

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.113
which has really been
quite successful.

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:56.215
The numbers of infections
in this country

00:01:56.215 --> 00:02:00.386
are going down substantially,
related to the fact

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:03.789
that we now have
about 50-plus percent

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:06.159
of the adult population
is fully vaccinated,

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:11.130
and about 64%
of the population of adults

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:14.300
have had at least one dose
of a two-dose regimen.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:18.271
We want to hit 70%
of the adult population

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.339
vaccinated by July 4th.

00:02:20.339 --> 00:02:23.810
Several states, about 14 states,
have already done that.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.412
So we're really continuing
to emphasize the need

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:28.881
and the importance
to get vaccinated,

00:02:28.881 --> 00:02:31.117
not only for your own
safety and health,

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:32.351
but for that of your family,

00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:34.420
as well as
the community in general.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.122
-That's why you're
on our show tonight.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.758
We want to tell
all of our viewers out there

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:41.794
to get vaccinated
and get those numbers up.

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:44.063
We're very close.
I don't know if you --

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:46.332
Of course you heard the news.
But New York --

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.566
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:49.936
Maybe I'm the first person
to tell you, but...

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.003
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:52.738
...New York has hit 70%.

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.941
So, yeah. We're pretty --

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:57.210
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:58.811
-You know, that's really --

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.713
Jimmy, that's really good news
for New York.

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:02.348
I mean, they have gotten

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:05.851
a good component
of their people vaccinated.

00:03:05.851 --> 00:03:08.154
That means that they
will be able to open

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:12.658
and get things back to normal
in a much safer environment

00:03:12.658 --> 00:03:14.961
than if there were very low
level of vaccinees.

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:16.996
So that's really the answer.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.865
California's doing
the same thing.

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:22.001
Today, Governor Newsom
is just right on the same track

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:24.269
as New York, as the same thing.

00:03:24.269 --> 00:03:26.639
So, if the people want to
get rid of constraints,

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:30.809
they want to get back to normal,
to do things that we all love,

00:03:30.809 --> 00:03:32.544
get vaccinated,
and we'll get us there.

00:03:32.544 --> 00:03:34.247
That's the answer
to all of this.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:36.415
-That's right. Now, this --

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:39.284
Let's talk a little about,
the Biden administration

00:03:39.284 --> 00:03:42.755
is calling this month
the National Month of Action.

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:43.889
-Right.

00:03:43.889 --> 00:03:47.293
-Because we got to
get those numbers to 70%?

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:48.861
75$?

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:50.329
-Well, we want to go above that.

00:03:50.329 --> 00:03:54.500
The goal, Jimmy, is to get us
to 70% of the adult population

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.969
vaccinated by the 4th of July.

00:03:56.969 --> 00:03:59.271
But that doesn't mean
we want to stop there.

00:03:59.271 --> 00:04:01.540
We want to keep going
beyond the 4th of July

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.943
and get more and more
people vaccinated,

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:05.378
because when you get

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:09.349
the overwhelming proportion
of the population vaccinated,

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:12.751
then there's no way that that
virus is going to resurge again.

00:04:12.751 --> 00:04:14.120
I mean, that's the answer.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.357
It has been traditionally,
with other infections, diseases,

00:04:17.357 --> 00:04:19.892
and we're seeing now every place

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:23.696
that there has been an increase
in the percentage of vaccine,

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:26.298
there has been
a concomitant diminution

00:04:26.298 --> 00:04:29.001
and decrease
in the number of infections.

00:04:29.001 --> 00:04:30.637
So we really want
to go all the way.

00:04:30.637 --> 00:04:33.739
We don't want
to stop at 75% or 80%.

00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:37.243
We want to get as many people
vaccinated as we possibly can.

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:40.246
And that's what we're talking
about this Month of Action,

00:04:40.246 --> 00:04:43.983
the march towards getting
more and more people vaccinated.

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:48.588
-Well, I hope everyone that
watches our show hasn't had one

00:04:48.588 --> 00:04:50.722
thinks again and gets one
and gets vaccinated.

00:04:50.722 --> 00:04:52.058
Let's get that number up.

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:54.093
And like you said,
don't stop at 70%.

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.361
Go past 70%.

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:57.263
And I -- Well,
speaking of not stopping,

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:58.698
you have not stopped, buddy.

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:02.335
And I got to say,
that's pretty awesome.

00:05:02.335 --> 00:05:04.003
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:05.371
Don't stop.

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:07.006
Don't stop. You're fantastic.

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:08.541
-I'm not going to stop, Jimmy,
don't worry.

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:09.776
-I appreciate it.
I appreciate it.

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:11.544
-Thank you.
-Dr. Anthony Fauci, everybody.

